From db5e0ea179dd802071e3f66d964ddb62313e99a4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: xhwxt <xhwxt@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 01:56:59 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix: self-hosted web parity patches

- file: add listWorkspaceFiles compat method (remote page v3.14.0 @ menu
  calls the pre-3.14.3 one-shot API; server only had Length/Range split)
- server: register minimal IWindowControllerService backed by the same
  in-process IZCodeTaskService, so the web direct page sidebar task list
  (window-controller channel) works without a desktop host
- web: pass URL token to /api/server-info fetch (token mode previously
  always 401'd, workspace announcement never reached the page)
- web: enable restoreSession so the conversation backing workspace tab
  is restored at startup (same useTabPersistence path as desktop)
- shared: server-info workspace entry may carry optional workspacePurpose
  (conversation backing dir announced as conversation, matching desktop
  startupWorkspace semantics)
